/// Ghost Train block — Upper/Lower A/B split. See rules/strength-authoring.md for the spec
/// this implements and strength/notes.md for the full design writeup.
///
/// DUMBBELL CONVERSION (2026-08-04): athlete's home gym has no barbell, only an adjustable
/// Bowflex SelectTech 552 pair (5-52.5lb per hand, 2.5lb increments) — home is the primary
/// training location for this block, so Squat, Bench Press, Bent Over Row, Overhead Press, and
/// Incline Bench Press are now the Dumbbell equipment variant. Romanian Deadlift has no Dumbbell
/// variant in Liftosaur's exercise list, so it's replaced with Stiff Leg Deadlift, Dumbbell (same
/// hip-hinge pattern, same equipment). Bulgarian Split Squat was already dumbbell-equipment by
/// default and is unchanged.
///
/// Bench Press / Bent Over Row / Overhead Press start higher than the initial conservative
/// estimate, per the athlete's own correction (2026-08-04): 35/35/20lb instead of 15/15/12.5lb.
///
/// RE-BASED AGAIN (2026-08-04, evening) from the FIRST REAL SESSION — Week 1 Upper A, logged in
/// Liftosaur. Prescription vs. actual: Bench 35 -> 35 (correct), Row 35 -> 25, OHP 20 -> 25,
/// Pallof 20 -> 27.5. So the morning's correction overshot the row and undershot the other two.
///   * Bent Over Row is now DECOUPLED from Bench and runs its own ladder, 25 -> 37.5lb by Week 9.
///     Locking the two to identical numbers was always arbitrary. Side effect: row no longer
///     approaches the SelectTech ceiling, so that watch item now applies to BENCH ONLY.
///   * Overhead Press re-based +5: 25 -> 35lb by Week 9.
///   * Pallof Press re-based +7.5: 27.5 -> 32.5lb.
/// Bench Press keeps its ladder and still peaks at 47.5lb/hand by Week 9 — only 5lb (2 increments)
/// under the SelectTech's 52.5lb ceiling. STILL THE ONE TO WATCH: if bench moves even one week
/// ahead of schedule it runs out of dumbbell before the block ends.
/// Squat/Stiff Leg Deadlift/Incline Bench Press are unaffected, still peaking at 32.5/32.5/27.5.
///
/// Every week is fully self-contained (no reliance on Liftoscript's carry-forward mechanism —
/// see strength/notes.md for why). Spot-verified via run_playground with real complete_set()
/// commands against weeks 1 and 9 (including the Bench/Row/OHP peak) before pushing.


# Week 1

## Lower A — primary strength
main: Squat, Dumbbell / ! 3x5 / 2x5 / 1x5 / 20lb / 180s
main: Stiff Leg Deadlift, Dumbbell / ! 3x6 / 2x6 / 1x6 / 20lb / 150s
accessory: Bulgarian Split Squat / 3x8 / 30lb / 90s
core: Hanging Leg Raise / 3x10 / 0lb / 60s

## Upper A
main: Bench Press, Dumbbell / ! 3x5 / 2x5 / 1x5 / 35lb / 180s
main: Bent Over Row, Dumbbell / 3x8 / 25lb / 120s
accessory: Overhead Press, Dumbbell / 3x8 / 25lb / 90s
core: Pallof Press / 3x10 / 27.5lb / 60s

## Lower B — runner-specific, low fatigue
/// Single Leg Calf Raise is the highest-value accessory in the whole program for
/// ultra durability — protect this one when trimming volume, cut something else first.
// Liftosaur has no per-side tracking for custom exercises (only certain built-ins like
// Single Leg Deadlift get that automatically). 8 sets = 4 per leg, same volume as before —
// just split so each leg gets its own field. Alternate: odd sets right, even sets left.
accessory: Single Leg Calf Raise / 8x12 / 0lb / 60s
// Couch-anchored: hook feet under a couch or other heavy, stable furniture instead of a
// bench — no bench at home. Same exercise, same stimulus.
accessory: Nordic Curl / 3x6 / 0lb / 90s
accessory: Single Leg Deadlift / 3x10 / 25lb / 60s
// Timed holds have no per-side tracking at all (even built-in exercises) — the `|` here is
// hold-time|rest-time, not left|right. 6 sets = 3 holds per side, same as before. Alternate:
// odd sets right, even sets left.
accessory: Copenhagen Plank / 6x1 30s|30s
core: Dead Bug / 3x12 / 0lb / 45s

## Upper B
/// Champion Plan's Sunday flex day; paired with the easy/mod run.
main: Pull Up / ! 3x6 / 2x6 / 1x6 / 10lb / 150s / update: custom() {~
  if (setIndex == 0) {
    weights = bodyweight + originalWeights[ns]
  }
~}
main: Incline Bench Press, Dumbbell / 3x8 / 15lb / 120s
accessory: Face Pull / 3x15 / 30lb / 60s
core: Side Plank / 3x1 30s|30s



